///| Red-team regression tests for packages/ssh @ 81a2816 (branch feat/pkg-ssh).
///|
///| Every `p0_*` / `p1_*` / `p2_*` test asserts the behaviour of the reference — a real OpenSSH_10.3p1
///| sshd(8) / ssh-keygen(1) (see run_audit.sh "sshd" step) and/or Go golang.org/x/crypto/ssh v0.38.0 —
///| so a FAILURE is the evidence. `control_*` tests are attacks Pion survives and must keep PASSING.
///| Vectors under ./vectors were produced by ssh-keygen (OpenSSH_10.3p1) or, for craft_*, by
///| `oracle craft` signing with vectors/ca_ed (a throw-away test CA).

